  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate evocation; <strong>CL</strong> 9th; <strong>Slot</strong> finger; <strong>Price</strong> 12,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> —</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThe ether teaches its children that the world is mutable in ways that are nearly impossible to imagine, and this simple silver band is a tool by which that mutation can be achieved. When creating a band of transient realities, choose a shape manifestation. The wearer of the band of transient realities treats the ether point cost of the chosen shape manifestation as though it were 1 lower, to a minimum of 1 ether point.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Ring, the chosen manifestation; <strong>Cost</strong> 6,000 gp</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-items#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
